OL,3,GNEWSAHow new buy-before-you-board rule
OL,4,Awill impact you
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new system is set to be introduced to
OL,7,Fchange the way passengers pay to use
OL,8,Fthe Midlands Metro.
OL,10,FFrom September, a Buy Before You Board
OL,11,Fscheme will be in place, meaning you
OL,12,Fcan no longer purchase a ticket while
OL,13,Fon board the service.
OL,15,FInstead, conductors will no longer be
OL,16,Fon board and a valid ticket or pass
OL,17,Fmust be bought before customers set
OL,18,Ffoot on the tram.
OL,20,FCustomers can either use a ticket
OL,21,Fmachine, the MyMetro app or Swift card.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
